20	//     whitespace added, strings written as equivalent \uXXXX escapes — must
21	//     leave the old cursor usable, and the remaining pages must keep the
22	//     original block hashes and in-block positions, never repeat a record
23	//     already read, never merge duplicate in-block identifiers, and report the
24	//     same fixed-range statistics and timestamp presence/values;
25	//   - a snapshot that changes anything inside the pinned range — including
26	//     only turning an already-read block's missing timestamp into a real zero,
27	//     while its hash, parent, and transactions stay identical and the unread
28	//     transactions are unchanged — must fail the continuation with
29	//     ErrQueryChanged (never ErrInvalidArgument), returning no hits, no cursor,
30	//     and no statistics;
